*** Settings ***
Documentation
    ...  This test case is created to trigger SoC recovery.
    ...  Parameter actL1FastAutoHealing must be set to false.
    ...  Test will randomly select SoC from ABIN or ABIO.
    ...  Site reset is performed to clear all counters.
    ...  Fault will be generated by crashing DSP resulting in L1Soc NR UL DSP group.
    ...  Alarms are verified not to appear in RawAlarmHistory.
    ...  Also recovery action will be checked and counter is 0 or not present in BTS counters.

Resource  ../../common_resources/ca_FM_general.robot


*** Variables ***
${STARTUP_TIMEOUT}  600  # Timeout for SBTS to recover after site reset
${RAT_TYPE}  NR  # SOC's cells type
${UNIT_TYPE}  ${EMPTY}  # BBMOD type can be ABIO, ABIN, aSOE, ASOF, ABIP, ASOG, ASOH
${CRASH_COMMAND}  devmem 0x87E044201600 64 1  # Command to trigger the crash


